  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1376f052a41f43242b6634233346e3e4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Right5.1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueLine
  speakerName: ROXANNE
  line: The contract has a third name. Not his. Not mine. Madeleine Noir. Co-owner.
    Issuing party. I signed something with her name in the indemnity clause and I
    never read it carefully enough to find it.She owns half this building. With him
    gone, she owns all of it. I'm losing the only protection I had. She's acquiring
    a property. Ask yourself who benefits more.
